<title>USA: Montgomery Cty, Md., $115 mln won by Merrill.</title>
<headline>Montgomery Cty, Md., $115 mln won by Merrill.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. said Tuesday it won $115 million Montgomery County, Md., unlimited tax bonds at a true interest cost of 5.321 percent.</p>
</text>
